=== 1. set -- with no operands clears the positionals
n=0 all=[]
=== 2. set -- replaces them
n=2 1=x 2=y z
=== 3. options alone leave them alone
n=2 all=[keep me]
=== 4. options then -- clears
n=0
=== 5. options then operands
n=2 all=[p q]
=== 6. - alone keeps them, - with operands replaces them
n=2 1=one
n=1 1=three
=== 7. - turns xtrace off
+ set - four five
n=2 all=[four five] xtrace=off
=== 8. operands that look like options after --
n=3 all=[-x +f --] xtrace=off
=== 9. in a function the caller's positionals come back
inside n=0
after n=2 all=[outer args]
